  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: Fixed duplicated Tags issue #155 2026-03-13\n- fix: recognize net10+ target frameworks for modern C# feature emission 2026-03-11\n- feat: add --base-url CLI option with validation, tests, and docs 2026-03-11\n- feat: add --security-scheme CLI option for specs missing auth (#140) 2026-03-10\n- feat: add Claude Code skill for AI-assisted SDK generation 2026-03-10\n- feat: migrate initialize command from .sln to .slnx format 2026-03-09\n- feat: use default/const values from OpenAPI parameters as C# default parameter values 2026-03-05\n- feat: improve oneOf/anyOf ergonomics with semantic variant naming (#133) 2026-03-05\n- feat: More broad support for .http files 2026-03-04\n- feat: Added support for ServerSentEvents. 2026-03-04\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: Use squash merge in auto-merge workflow template 2026-03-19\n- fix: Don't send empty query values for optional AnyOf parameters 2026-03-19\n- Add explicit [JsonSerializable] attributes per type for AOT compatibility (#173) 2026-03-19\n- fix: Fixed Vectara spec issues. 2026-03-15\n- Merge pull request #162 from tryAGI/codex/sanitize-openapi-discriminators 2026-03-14\n- fix: sanitize dangling OpenAPI discriminators 2026-03-14\n- fix: skip unresolved nested schema refs 2026-03-14\n- fix: skip blank NDJSON stream lines 2026-03-14\n- fix: emit ResponseStream for CLI-generated SDKs (#157) 2026-03-13\n- fix: emit ResponseStream for CLI-generated SDKs 2026-03-13",
